          "front": "How can one identify if a company is a private limited company versus a public limited company based solely on its name suffix?",
          "back": "A private limited company name ends with \"Pvt Ltd\" or \"Ltd\" indicating private status. A public limited company name ends with just \"Limited.\" For example, Tata Sons Private Limited is private, while Tata Steel Limited is public."
