      "created_at": "2026-11-06 08:57:15",
      "transcript_text": "Moving on to Frameworks to understand the importance of family involvement. Look at this particular image in front of you. This particular framework starts with the input which is the family involvement and ends with the outcome on both the economics and the economic dimension as well as the non-economic dimension which captures the two broad objectives of a family firm and you have feedback loops all throughout. From the family involvement we move to understanding the family behavioral disposition to the firm. This has two elements to it. One is the family willingness. This captures the family's favorable disposition to continue and transition this business across generations. The second is the family's ability. Ability refers to the discretion and the competence in how they are allocating resources, capabilities and making decisions relating to the family business. The next box refers to the strategic drivers of the family firm's behaviour. Here we are talking about three important things, goals, governance and resources. In the family firm behaviour we are referring to different elements including for example, professionalisation, innovation, restructuring, M&D and all these regular business aspects of the family business. And if you now move across this diagram from left to right you start with the family involvement, move to the behavioral disposition, then come the strategic drivers, the family firm's behaviour and finally ending with the family firm outcomes with a regular feedback loop all throughout the process.",
