          "explanation": "This tests the **Distractor Trap**. If a successor commits primarily due to family expectations, they are exhibiting normative commitment, not effective commitment. An examiner might present this scenario and ask the student to distinguish between commitment driven by internal alignment (effective) versus external pressure (normative).",
          "key_concept": "Normative vs. Effective Commitment"
