          "explanation": "Option B illustrates the false dichotomy fallacy because the manager is presenting only two choices (adopt AI features this quarter OR become irrelevant) when several other alternatives exist, such as running a smaller AI pilot, adding AI to one high-value part of the product first, or other strategic responses. The lecture specifically uses an AI example to show how this fallacy creates urgency around a false binary choice.",
          "key_concept": "False dichotomy fallacy"
