          "explanation": "The professor defined the researcher's role as being \"the blood that flows across all these functions\" and \"an unbiased neutral voice in the room.\" The core purpose is to bridge the gap between functional pillars by bringing customer feedback to the forefront. Option A confuses the role with decision-making authority; Option C describes administrative tasks only; Option D suggests compromising integrity for harmony.",
