          "correct_index": 1,
          "explanation": "The professor stated: \"What I would do is I would, so my closest reference is the manual labor part of it, right. So how are the HR folk summarizing? How are the admin summarizing?\" This establishes proxy behaviors from adjacent functions as the method for novel scenarios. Option A is incorrect because the lecture specifically said we don't have benchmarks for AI like we do for soap. Option C is an avoidance strategy not suggested. Option D ignores the customer voice the researcher is meant to provide.",
