          "correct_index": 1,
          "difficulty": "Easy | Direct",
          "explanation": "The transcript states: \"The lesson is not bootstrap for 10 years. It is that preserving control has less consequences. Patience, constraint, and a different growth path.\" Option A misrepresents the lesson. Option C is not the lesson from his story. Option D contradicts the bootstrapping example.",
