          "correct_index": 3,
          "difficulty": "Moderate | Conceptual",
          "explanation": "The transcript lists confirmatory bias, overconfidence, planning fallacy, and escalation of commitment. Loss aversion is a behavioral economics concept not mentioned in this specific lecture video. The examiner tests whether students can distinguish between biases discussed and those that were not.",
