          "explanation": "The transcript explicitly states: \"the important mechanism is that team formation. Experienced founders can recruit former colleagues and begin with a larger team.\" Option A is a distractor as the study focuses on team dynamics, not personal capital. Option C is a trap because risk tolerance is not discussed as the primary mechanism. Option D is outside the scope of the discussed research.",
