          "explanation": "The transcript states that in 2000, the dot-com bust happened, and Siemens said they couldn't take him in, which means he was left with no job. This forced entry into the government sector via the Karnataka IT department. Option A is incorrect as the bust hurt startups too, Option C misattributes the destination, and Option D is chronologically impossible as Mapunity started later.",
