          "correct_index": 1,
          "explanation": "Pradeep joined TechPoint Solutions for a salary and worked on Mapunity in the evenings. This \"double-timing\" strategy allowed him to sustain himself financially until Mapunity got its first cheque. Option A describes a high-risk move not taken here, Option C sets an arbitrary funding milestone not mentioned, and Option D contradicts the need for personal income.",
          "key_concept": "Double-Timing / Runway Strategy"
