          "correct_index": 1,
          "explanation": "The transcript mentions that Pradeep needed money for his growing family, while his co-founders Ashwin and Pandian were okay working without money. This illustrates that the founding team's situation varies; some can take risk, others cannot. Option A is false as they were bootstrapping, Option C is factually wrong, and Option D misrepresents the discussion.",
