          "explanation": "The transcript clearly states that the student had an offer from JustBooks and an offer from HP, and that \"parents were pushing her for HP.\" She eventually succumbed to parental pressure and joined HP, despite being keen on JustBooks. The professor uses this to illustrate the tension between personal passion and familial expectation.",
