          "difficulty": "Easy | Conceptual",
          "explanation": "The professor explicitly closes the lecture with this sentiment: \"Don't join because I said so or somebody else said so. Your friends are saying so. Join if you truly believe that is the kind of space that you would like to learn from.\" He emphasizes personal belief and passion over peer pressure or external validation as the deciding factor.",
