            "yield_score": 10,
            "why_essential": "Provides the critical decision framework: use calculated columns for static row-level values needed for filtering/axes; use calculated measures for dynamic aggregations that must react to user filters and slicers in real-time.",
            "key_takeaway": "Always ask 'Does this need to change automatically based on filters?' if yes, it's a measure; if it needs to be on an axis or used for filtering, it's a column."
