          "question": "An acquirer firm has a PE ratio of 20 and an EPS of Rs. 50. A target firm has a PE ratio of 5 and an EPS of Rs. 50. Assuming an all-equity swap with no synergies and no premium, which of the following statements is most accurate regarding the post-merger EPS?",
