          "question": "Based on the lecture transcript, explain how the composition and leadership of a family business board influence the firm's decision to internationalise. In your answer, discuss the specific roles of the family Chairman, independent directors, and cross-generational family members, and how their interactions affect the resistance to or facilitation of outside capital.",
