          "explanation": "The correct answer is B. Transformation steps like changing data types (e.g., setting a column to \"Date\" instead of \"Text\") are essential for the correct functioning of visualisations and time intelligence functions. Option A is incorrect as file size reduction is a secondary benefit, not the primary analytical purpose. Option C is incorrect because relationships are defined in the Model view, not via data type changes. Option D relates to sharing, not assembly.",
