            "trap_warning": "Be precise about the distinction between the mechanical transfer of the premium and the economic creation of synergy.",
            "distractor_analysis": "B is tricky: while the target receives the premium price, the statement implies a universal truth about 'capturing the full premium' which can be misleading if the premium was paid from goodwill that disappears. D is tricky because if the offer price is at fair value (no premium), target shareholders do not benefit above market price."
