            "distractor_analysis": "Option A traps students who focus on the founder's expressed attitude rather than the established criterion of whether disagreement actually survives contact. Option C traps those who prioritize founder self-assessment over observable behavioral patterns. Option D traps the misconception that mere verbal support creates stability, when the module emphasizes that the survival of disagreement is what matters for retention."
