            "trap_warning": "A common fallacy is to treat the four forces as independent and uniformly impactful. The conceptual model requires analyzing the intersection of these forces with the specific vulnerabilities of the family firm format.",
            "distractor_analysis": "Option C traps students who assume ESG is a universal constant without firm-specific variation. Option D traps those who view succession as a linear, isolated event rather than a strategic pivot point interacting with external forces."
